  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: Maxler is a premium sports nutrition and supplement brand founded in Germany in 2003. Our products are science-based, made with high-quality ingredients and produced in Europe for performance, health and everyday wellness.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: Over 20 years of expertise, clean formulations without unnecessary ingredients, and product lines tailored to different needs – from professional athletes to daily health routines.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Affiliates earn 10% commission per order via trackable affiliate links or coupon codes. Payments are made via PayPal or bank transfer.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: Promote Maxler through authentic fitness, nutrition or wellness content. Integrate products into routines, workouts or recipes and share affiliate links or coupons across social media, blogs or videos.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information: Worldwide affiliates welcome. Auto-approval. No customer auto-discounts. Trackable links and long-term partnerships available.</p></div></div>",
