  "term_and_condition": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">AFFILIATE PROGRAM TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">1. Introduction</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">These Terms &amp; Conditions (\"Agreement\") govern participation in the affiliate program operated by GTI GmbH (\"Company\", \"we\", \"us\"). By registering as an affiliate, you agree to be bound by this Agreement.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">2. Eligibility</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You must be at least 18 years old and legally capable of entering into contracts. You act as an independent contractor and not as an employee, agent, or partner of the Company.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">3. Registration and Account</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">You agree to provide accurate and complete information. We reserve the right to approve or reject any application at our sole discretion.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">4. Affiliate Links and Tracking</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Affiliates will receive a unique referral link and/or discount code. Commissions are tracked via the UpPromote platform. We are not responsible for tracking errors caused by third-party systems, browser settings, or ad blockers.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">5. Commission and Payments</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Commission is paid on confirmed and completed orders only.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Orders that are cancelled, returned, or refunded will not be eligible for commission.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Payments are made periodically as defined in the affiliate dashboard.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Affiliates are solely responsible for any taxes, VAT, or other charges applicable in their country.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">6. Advertising and Compliance</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Affiliates must:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Clearly disclose advertising relationships (e.g. “Werbung”, “Ad”).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Comply with all applicable laws, including EU and local advertising regulations.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Avoid misleading, false, or unverified claims, especially regarding health, nutrition, or medical effects.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Not present themselves as the official brand or company representative.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">7. Prohibited Activities</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The following are strictly prohibited:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Self-referrals (placing orders using your own affiliate link).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Brand bidding (using our brand name in paid ads such as Google Ads without permission).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Spam, unsolicited messages, or misleading promotions.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Cookie stuffing, fraud, or manipulation of tracking.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:'Century Gothic', sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">- Publishing content that is illegal, offensive, or harmful to the brand.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.2;margin-right:19.5pt;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bot